          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Choosing a pickleball paddle gets much simpler when you take the decisions in order. Settle weight and grip first, because they decide comfort and arm health. Then pick a core thickness and face material that match how much you value control against pop. Shape, budget and approval narrow the field from there.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
